{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"rlc-circuit-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"rlc-circuit-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["rlc-circuit-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Sa resonansiya, ang isang ideal na seryeng RLC ay may minimum na impedansiya na katumbas ng R; ang isang ideal na paralelong RLC ay may maximum na impedansiya na katumbas ng R. Ang kasalukuyang at boltahe na pag-aasal ay kaya naiiba kahit na ang ideal na f₀ ay pareho.","record_id":"a62af08d09251753904ef6def67c13d54c7975e902a4d08e371a4cde8ac85aca","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.5256671054999629,"source":"At resonance, an ideal series RLC has minimum impedance equal to R; an ideal parallel RLC has maximum impedance equal to R. Current and voltage behavior therefore differ even though ideal f₀ is the same.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"a0027fb9c91e4376b4b288a1bf0485cb799a4f5fc2a2d349880e24e09cd01b09","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Sa resonansiya, ang isang ideal na seryeng RLC ay may minimum na impedansiya na katumbas ng R; ang isang ideal na paralelong RLC ay may maximum na impedansiya na katumbas ng R. Ang kasalukuyang at boltahe na pag-aasal ay kaya naiiba kahit na ang ideal na f₀ ay pareho.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
